    {
      "game": "ARC Raiders",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/10142/450x258/arc-raiders-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1793073600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/10142-buy-arc-raiders-pc-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-88b66ad",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "C'est un bon jeu, je le trouve très équilibrer mais les joueur PvP peuvent gâcher l’expérience de jeu des nouveaux joueur car il faut quand même a mon goûts un bonne trentaine d'heure pour bien comprendre les mécaniques de chaque Arc et le gameplay en générale mais les joueur expérimenté peuvent venir perturbé cette apprentissage"
    },
    {
      "game": "Days Gone",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/6791/450x258/days-gone-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1793073600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/6791-buy-days-gone-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "The Provokator",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/11884263-1597424779.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "This is arguably the game's greatest strength.\n\n\n\n- Hordes can consist of a massive number of zombies.\n\n\n\n- Once they spot you, they can pursue and surround you.\n\n\n\n- You have to carefully consider your movement and how you’ll make your escape.\n\n\n\n- Things get particularly interesting later on, once you have access to more weapons and options.\n\n\n\nMy advice: Don't feel like you have to take down every horde you encounter early on. Sometimes, it’s smarter to run away and return once you’re better equipped.\n\n\n\n2. ?️ The Motorcycle and the Survival Experience\n\n\n\nYour motorcycle is more than just a means of transport. You need to keep track of:\n\n\n\n- Fuel.\n\n\n\n- Damage and repairs.\n\n\n\n- Upgrades.\n\n\n\n- Performance enhancements.\n\n\n\nThis creates the genuine feeling that you are traveling through a dangerous world, rather than simply moving from one mission to the next.\n\n\n\n3. ? Atmosphere and Open World\n\n\n\nForests, abandoned structures, fog, rain, and shifting weather conditions do an excellent job of establishing a post-apocalyptic atmosphere.\n\n\n\nThe game truly shines when you’re riding through the woods as dusk falls, and you suddenly hear enemies lurking nearby."
    },
    {
      "game": "Titanfall 2",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/1273/450x258/titanfall-2-pc-game-ea-app-cover.jpg?v=1793073600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/1273-buy-titanfall-2-pc-game-ea-app/",
      "user": "gamer-b45cca7",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "One of the most underrated, greatest single player campaigns of the last 20 years. I already owned this on the PS4 and bought it again on the PC to try out the new VR mod with my PSVR2 and PS2PC Adapter. It does the near impossible task of making an already great game even better and more immersive. You can't go wrong in our out of VR. One of the best, just wish it was longer but it's hard not to ask for more of a good thing."
    },
